# Add this line to the droplet's existing crontab (crontab -e) alongside
# everything else already there. No API key needed -- GOES-18 GLM data on
# AWS Open Data is unauthenticated.
#
# Every 5 minutes -- lightning has no fixed issuance schedule to align
# to, so like columbia-basin-alerts-map this is a polling interval, not a
# cycle time. Tighter than the 24-hour companion project's 15-minute
# cadence since this is the real-time product.

*/5 * * * * /opt/ingalls-weather-scripts/columbia-basin-lightning-realtime-map/venv/bin/python3 /opt/ingalls-weather-scripts/columbia-basin-lightning-realtime-map/deploy/publish_lightning.py >> /opt/ingalls-weather-scripts/columbia-basin-lightning-realtime-map/state/cron.log 2>&1
